# .otto/ — Otto infrastructure tool working directory.
# The trailing slash restricts matching to directories only; a plain file
# named .otto is NOT ignored. Without the trailing slash (.otto), a file
# named .otto would also be ignored (false positive). With a leading slash
# (/.otto/), only the root .otto/ is matched, missing nested occurrences
# (false negative). The bare .otto/ pattern is the narrowest correct choice.
.otto/
